From 4476c42210c81b6597ab9533a9d515813d20c796 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:01:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arifi-sync: re-key the sha-pinned ledgers after the post-x1i
 trailer reword

The trailer reword (reword.py, B1c) replayed c23bd8cc5e..69927fe1d2 with the same trees and new
messages, so 91 commit shas changed. Every full sha of a rewritten commit in the ledgers
below is replaced by its new sha (map: reword-commit-map.tsv). Abbreviated shas in prose
fields are not rewritten. Commits under c23bd8cc5e are untouched.
  tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release engineering for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Origin: release-prep (HQ82)
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - ledger keys only; no inference code path is touched.
---
 tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json | 32 ++++++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
index 383e5fd4e0..5972dec371 100644
