       "id": "vulkan-fa-sparse-prefill-qsa",
       "status": "active",
       "mechanism": "Vulkan flash-attention sparse gather for QSA PREFILL (Strata FEATURE-MAP row 26, lane 301). A sparse-hinted FA (n_kv_max > 0) with N > 8 now takes the gqa layout when the sparse gate's own conditions hold (raw F16 K/V, KV >= max(4096, 2*n_kv_max)); the shader resolves per-token rows (sparse_base uses gqa_iq1 = token), so each prefill query reads only its ~2051 selected cells instead of dense masked attention over all n_kv. Runtime switches: GGML_ARIFI_FA_SPARSE_PREFILL=0 restores dense prefill, GGML_ARIFI_FA_SPARSE_PREFILL_MIN_RATIO; RED plant GGML_ARIFI_QSA_RED_PLANT=1.",
