@@ -1921,9 +1921,9 @@
       "status": "active",
       "_registered": "2026-10-06, lane-302 (Opus 5.5). Route A lever 1 (rows per workgroup of the gather pipelines). Default ON for IQ3_S only.",
       "mechanism": "The IQ3_S MUL_MAT_ID gather pipeline (n_tokens 2..8) runs 2 weight rows per workgroup instead of rm_iq (4 on non-GCN AMD). Per-row reduction does not depend on NUM_ROWS (mul_mat_vec_base.glsl reduce_result), so output is byte-identical. GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER_ROWS=1|2|4|8 overrides every gather type.",
