       "_registered": "2026-10-06, lane-302 (Opus 5.5). Route A levers 3+4 (IQ2_S gather shader body). Default ON (GGML_ARIFI_IQ2S_BODY unset = 5) from the flip commit (commit-msg-15).",
       "mechanism": "mul_mat_vec_iq2_s.comp spec constant 3 on the IQ2_S MUL_MAT_ID gather pipeline: body 5 = int8 packed sign application ((g ^ 0xFF) + 1 per byte; iq2s grid bytes are never 0, so no -0) plus a batched LDS grid init (every thread loads its 16 table entries into registers, then stores; the ISA serialized global_load -> s_waitcnt vmcnt(0) chain drops from 16 to 2 waits). Same table, same LDS bytes, same arithmetic order: byte-identical. GGML_ARIFI_IQ2S_BODY=0 = legacy body; 1 = int8 body only; 4 = legacy body + batched init; 2 = diagnostic (skip init, wrong output); 3 = planted wrong arm.",
